<section id="review" class="ns-section ns-review" aria-labelledby="review-title">
  <div class="ns-container ns-editorial-grid">
    <header class="ns-section-heading">
      <h2 id="review-title" class="t-heading">How a pilot works</h2>
      <p class="ns-lead">$9,500 fixed fee. Three to four weeks.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="ns-prose">
      <p class="ns-review__label" id="review-outline-label">What a pilot includes.</p>
      <dl class="ns-review__outline" aria-labelledby="review-outline-label">
        <div>
          <dt>One job</dt>
          <dd>One piece of recurring work, written down.</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>The limits</dt>
          <dd>The inboxes, folders and systems the agent can reach, and nothing else.</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>The approval step</dt>
          <dd>What waits for a person before it is sent or changed.</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>The acceptance test</dt>
          <dd>How we both check it was done right, agreed before work starts.</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
      <p>The pilot runs under a business account in your name. If we stop working together, you keep everything.</p>
      <div class="ns-actions">
        <%= link_to "Request a call", studio_contact_path(interest: "pilot"), data: { controller: "analytics", action: "click->analytics#track", analytics_event_param: "cta_clicked", analytics_cta_param: "request_a_call", analytics_location_param: "pilot", analytics_interest_param: "pilot" }, class: "sn-btn sn-btn--primary sn-btn--lg" %>
      </div>
      <h3 class="t-heading">Not sure which job to start with?</h3>
      <p>$3,500 fixed fee. One week.</p>
      <p>The Agent Readiness Review compares up to three recurring jobs and tells you which one an agent should take first, in writing.</p>
      <p>The full $3,500 is credited toward a pilot that starts within 60 days.</p>
      <p><%= link_to "/agent-readiness-review", class: "ns-text-link" do %>What the review includes <span aria-hidden="true">→</span><% end %></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
